+// A full collection between emission passes. Under `bun --smol` JSC runs
+// few full collections on this workload, so each pass's garbage stays in the
+// old generation: on bend2/src/coordinator/main.bend the heap grew by 6-27 GB
+// a pass until libpas exhausted its fixed 128 MiB compact-heap reservation
+// for page metadata (Baton #1017). A forced collection at each pass boundary
+// keeps the heap near the live set.
+function collect_full(): void {
+  (globalThis as { Bun?: { gc(force: boolean): void } }).Bun?.gc(true);
+}
+
 // Facts-only passes are OFF by default on this lineage. They converge
 // own/hot/stat before emitting C, but on the large fixtures they measured
 // 22-24% slower than the two full passes they replace, with identical output
@@ -3624,6 +3634,7 @@
